{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Real-time iOS Live Activities powered by push notifications.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"title":"PushwooshLiveActivities","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshLiveActivities"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"PushwooshLiveActivities","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Getting Started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/Examples"]},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup"],"title":"Classes"},{"title":"Protocols","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityContentState"]},{"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/AnyCodable","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/DefaultLiveActivityAttributes","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributeData","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityContentStateData"]},{"title":"Extended Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshBridge"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"PushwooshLiveActivities integrates Apple’s ActivityKit framework to deliver real-time updates to Live Activities on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island. Live Activities provide persistent, glanceable information that users can track without opening your app.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The module handles token registration, activity lifecycle management, and push notification delivery automatically. It supports both custom activity attributes and a default configuration for cross-platform scenarios.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup\/setup(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" for every attributes type your app uses ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"at launch","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application(_:didFinishLaunchingWithOptions:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or the SwiftUI "},{"code":"App.init","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), not lazily when a screen appears. Only a type registered in the current session is reconnected to its already-running activities so their push token can be re-uploaded after a cold start — for example an activity that started, or was scheduled to start, while the app was terminated. A type registered later (e.g. in a view’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAppear"},{"type":"text","text":") can’t receive remote updates until that screen is opened. ActivityKit exposes running activities only through the concrete "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Activity<Attributes>"},{"type":"text","text":" generic and does not persist the set of types across launches, so the SDK cannot reconnect a type it hasn’t been told about this session. The call is idempotent — registering at launch and again per-screen is safe."}]}],"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities/documentation/PushwooshLiveActivities/PushwooshBridge":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/pushwooshbridge","role":"collection","type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshBridge","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshBridge"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities/documentation/PushwooshLiveActivities/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/pushwooshliveactivityattributes","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Protocol for defining custom Live Activity attributes."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes"}],"title":"PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities\/documentation\/PushwooshLiveActivities\/PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshLiveActivityAttributes"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshLiveActivities/documentation/PushwooshLiveActivities/PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSetup":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshliveactivities\/pushwooshliveactivitiesimplementationsetup","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Orchestrates iOS Live Activities integration with Pushwoosh push notifications."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PushwooshLiveActivitiesImplementationSe